  (text "DAU DO DIEN DUNG: TLC555 (ban I) dao dong ~0.5-0.7MHz, duty 50%\n(RT=R12 10k, CT=C14 100pF C0G). OSC_OUT -> R13 -> RS(R15 10k) ->\ndien cuc SENSE (C_dat ~15..250pF so voi GND) -> D1 tach dinh -> C17.\nR16/R17 chia 1/2 vao dai ATTEN2 (0..1.9V). Dat cang uot -> C cang lon\n-> bien do cang nho -> dien ap SOIL_ADC cang THAP."
    (at 20.32 27.94 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 88e61b26-a9c1-532b-bd09-ac3ca0991c2b)
  )
  (text "NTC 10k B3380 (RT1) dat tren than que, ~5cm duoi mat dat:\nnhiet do dat + bu nhiet cho dau do. Nuoi tu VSENS (0 ro khi ngu)."
    (at 20.32 160.02 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 7e90f224-35d6-5d0b-9800-d701a5f9f143)
  )
  (text "SHT40-AD1F (mang PTFE, IP67): nhiet/am khong khi.\nDat o vung co ranh phay cach nhiet, ho ra qua lo co mang.\nPull-up I2C noi VSENS: FW dat SDA/SCL Hi-Z truoc khi ngu."
    (at 190.5 160.02 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 4a0fd613-5281-599c-a12a-abdf9f8cb802)
  )
